Question: How often must an electricity operator in scope of the network code on cybersecurity update its cyber risk assessment?

Answer: The corpus does not say. It contains no article from the network code on cybersecurity (Regulation (EU) 2024/1366), so nothing in it sets an update frequency for an operator's cyber risk assessment. Cybersecurity appears only in passing: Article 40(1)(m) of Directive 2019/944 makes transmission system operators responsible for data management, including cybersecurity and data protection. Other review cycles in the corpus, such as storage consultations every five years, concern different subjects and cannot be applied to this question.

